From be719a993f2b5349e63d907911560cd84e0cbcfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 20:23:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Rebrand MUEVETE with a Kinetic Bold design system

Replace the comic-font/bubble-shadow teal-orange theme with a coherent
design system: near-black ink + off-white paper base, single coral
accent, Bricolage Grotesque (display) + Manrope (body) via next/font,
and consistent 10px/16px corner-radius scale with tactile button
feedback across the whole site.

- New color tokens and typography in tailwind.config.js/globals.css
- Retheme every page and shared component (nav, footer, cart, product
  cards, dialogs, admin panel, 404/loading) to the new tokens
- Replace emoji-as-icons with FontAwesome for a single icon system
- Fix pre-existing inconsistencies found along the way: off-palette
  raw Tailwind colors, a broken image reference on /register, native
  alert()/confirm() calls replaced with the app's toast/ConfirmDialog
  pattern, and dead/unused components and font files removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lnk4T93LH9WLa79FuvsXSG
